=head1 DESCRIPTION

An image file from a managed login branding style in a user pool.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 Bytes => Str

The image file, in Base64-encoded binary.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Category => Str

The category that the image corresponds to in your managed login
configuration. Managed login has asset categories for different types
of logos, backgrounds, and icons.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> ColorMode => Str

The display-mode target of the asset: light, dark, or browser-adaptive.
For example, Amazon Cognito displays a dark-mode image only when the
browser or application is in dark mode, but displays a browser-adaptive
file in all contexts.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Extension => Str

The file type of the image file.


=head2 ResourceId => Str

The ID of the asset.



